<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#087443">
<title>SARM - School Attendance & Records Manager</title>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f0f5f2;
    color: #222;
}

header {
    background: #087443;
    color: white;
    padding: 25px 15px;
    text-align: center;
}

header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 32px; }
header p { margin-bottom: 0; }

.container {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 25px auto;
    padding: 15px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #ddd;
}

h2 { color: #087443; }

input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px;
    margin: 9px 0;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 7px;
}

button {
    background: #087443;
    color: white;
    padding: 13px 20px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 7px;
    width: 100%;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover { background: #065c35; }

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    color: #666;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>SARM</h1>
<p>School Attendance & Records Manager</p>
<p>Smart School Management System</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

<div class="card">
<h2>Welcome to SARM</h2>
<p>Manage your school records, teachers, students and daily attendance in one place.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Administrator Login</h2>
<input type="text" placeholder="Admin Username">
<input type="password" placeholder="Admin Password">
<button onclick="alert('Admin login system will be activated in the next update.')">
Login as Admin
</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Staff Login</h2>
<input type="text" placeholder="Staff ID">
<input type="password" placeholder="Staff PIN">
<button onclick="alert('Staff login system will be activated in the next update.')">
Login as Staff
</button>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>About SARM</h2>
<p>SARM is designed to help schools manage attendance and educational records efficiently.</p>
</div>

</div>

<footer>
<p>SARM Web App V1.0</p>
<p>© 2026 School Attendance & Records Manager</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
